' 4+1 logical view (code, C4 level 4) - Code (C4 level 4) · the Booking aggregate (Dom/Bookings/Booking.cs)
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' For: whoever writes the code.
' Documented decision: The rules of a booking are in the entity, which returns results (CancellationOutcome and others) instead of throwing exceptions.
' Not drawn: the components that call the entity.
@startuml logical-code-booking
!include ../style.puml
title Logical view - code (C4 level 4): the Booking aggregate (Dom/Bookings/Booking.cs)

hide empty members

class "Booking" as D_BOOKING <<sealed>> {
  - Booking()
  + Id : Guid
  + PitchId : Guid
  + PlayerId : Guid?
  + CustomerName : string?
  + CustomerPhone : string?
  + IsForCustomer : bool
  + StartsAt : DateTime
  + EndsAt : DateTime
  + Price : decimal
  + Status : BookingStatus
  + CreatedAt : DateTime
  + CancelledAt : DateTime?
  + CancellationReason : string?
  + IsConfirmed : bool
  + SeriesId : Guid?
  ..
  + {static} ForPlayer(pitchId, playerId, startsAt, endsAt, price, now, seriesId = null) : Booking
  + {static} ForCustomer(pitchId, customerName, customerPhone, startsAt, endsAt, price, now) : Booking
  ..
  + CancellationDeadline(window) : DateTime
  + {static} CancellationDeadline(startsAt, window) : DateTime
  + CanBeCancelledByPlayer(window, now) : bool
  + {static} CanBeCancelledByPlayer(status, startsAt, window, now) : bool
  + CancelByPlayer(window, now) : CancellationOutcome
  + CancelByClub(reason, now) : ClubCancellationOutcome
  + MarkNoShow(now) : bool
  + RecordNoShow(now) : NoShowOutcome
  + UndoNoShow() : bool
  + HasStarted(now) : bool
  + Overlaps(startsAt, endsAt) : bool
  ..
  - {static} EnsureWindow(window) : TimeSpan
  - {static} EnsureUtc(value) : DateTime
}

enum "BookingStatus" as D_BOOKING_BookingStatus {
  Confirmed
  CancelledByPlayer
  CancelledByClub
  NoShow
}

enum "CancellationOutcome" as D_BOOKING_CancellationOutcome {
  Cancelled
  NotConfirmed
  OutsideWindow
}

enum "ClubCancellationOutcome" as D_BOOKING_ClubCancellationOutcome {
  Cancelled
  NotConfirmed
  AlreadyStarted
}

enum "NoShowOutcome" as D_BOOKING_NoShowOutcome {
  Marked
  NotConfirmed
  NotEnded
}

class "BookingStatuses" as D_BOOKING_BookingStatuses <<static>> {
  + {static} ToCode(status) : string
}

class "BookingRules" as D_BOOKING_BookingRules <<static>> {
  + {static} CancellationReasonMaximumLength = 200
}

D_BOOKING --> D_BOOKING_BookingStatus : Status
D_BOOKING ..> D_BOOKING_CancellationOutcome : CancelByPlayer
D_BOOKING ..> D_BOOKING_ClubCancellationOutcome : CancelByClub
D_BOOKING ..> D_BOOKING_NoShowOutcome : RecordNoShow
D_BOOKING_BookingStatuses ..> D_BOOKING_BookingStatus : confirmed, cancelled_by_player,\ncancelled_by_club, no_show

note right of D_BOOKING
  **Invariants in the methods**
  Every property has a private set; the constructor is private.
  ForPlayer: playerId ≠ Guid.Empty; ForCustomer: name and phone
  filled in (trimmed); both: EndsAt > StartsAt, Price > 0,
  Status = Confirmed, Id = Guid.CreateVersion7(), UTC instants.
  A method that returns a result changes the state only when
  the result is the success one (Cancelled, Marked, true).
  CancelByClub without a reason is a programming error (exception):
  the service validates first. The cancellation window comes in
  as an argument and is never stored in the booking.
  Overlaps is half-open [start, end), like bookings_no_overlap.
end note

@enduml
